{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veg Uprising</strong> is a real-time tactical stealth strategy game where you lead a squad of unstable vegetables through enemy-infested garden battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.poster.avif?t=1761926904\" width=960 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.webm?t=1761926904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.mp4?t=1761926904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a handcrafted tactical scenario. You\u2019ll sneak past patrolling weeds, crouch to stay hidden, use elevation to your advantage, and coordinate your squad to free captured allies or take out boss enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth is essential</strong>: crouching hides you from sight, but standing up makes noise that enemies can hear. You can\u2019t attack unless you\u2019re on the same ground level as your target, but enemies can hit you from above \u2014 so picking your position is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/36d9a867940beb40cd039857cc27bc27.avif?t=1761926904\" width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you unlock playable characters, each with their own movement quirks and combat personality. Before each mission, you assign loadout items to each character \u2014 traps, distractions, tools. Every decision has consequences, and the wrong combo can cost you the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEMO:\u00a0<br>This demo includes 13 levels to give you a nice taste of the solo play + 1 unlocked character to play strategically along with 1 boss fight to test your veg battle IQ. <br>The demo does not feature cosmetics/in-app purchases (only available in full version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120470?t=1761926904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/f7430f223e373b90099b3b4c167fd5283d9bc8c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761926904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/fd8fbca74fe3ea4d670572b227cd1a5c312dce25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761926904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/fd8fbca74fe3ea4d670572b227cd1a5c312dce25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761926904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veg Uprising</strong> is a real-time tactical stealth strategy game where you lead a squad of unstable vegetables through enemy-infested garden battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.poster.avif?t=1761926904\" width=960 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.webm?t=1761926904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.mp4?t=1761926904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a handcrafted tactical scenario. You\u2019ll sneak past patrolling weeds, crouch to stay hidden, use elevation to your advantage, and coordinate your squad to free captured allies or take out boss enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth is essential</strong>: crouching hides you from sight, but standing up makes noise that enemies can hear. You can\u2019t attack unless you\u2019re on the same ground level as your target, but enemies can hit you from above \u2014 so picking your position is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120470/extras/36d9a867940beb40cd039857cc27bc27.avif?t=1761926904\" width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you unlock playable characters, each with their own movement quirks and combat personality. Before each mission, you assign loadout items to each character \u2014 traps, distractions, tools. Every decision has consequences, and the wrong combo can cost you the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEMO:\u00a0<br>This demo includes 13 levels to give you a nice taste of the solo play + 1 unlocked character to play strategically along with 1 boss fight to test your veg battle IQ. <br>The demo does not feature cosmetics/in-app purchases (only available in full version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PixeCast Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3853570","name":"Veg Uprising"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy",